","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The closed walk from the root that goes down each child edge, in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and back up it after that subtree. The walk has 2n − 1 vertices and lists each edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position twice. The trivial walk for one vertex. O(n)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/trees\/rootedtree\/eulertour","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/Trees\/RootedTree\/eulerTour"}}}